From e64b64c750306bd8127c3d612a9614db7bc4e4a6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stefan <kloterstefan@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 11:27:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] Vizz 1.0: the name on the unit, its identity FM-1_8XY,
 its one-file installer

Vizz is a modified version of Skiff 1.4 for the VIZZ visualizer. What
the unit shows says so; code, comments and files keep Skiff's names,
and every credit and licence stays:

- the splash: Vizz, the version, on Skiff 1.4; ABOUT: VIZZ, based on
  Skiff 1.4 / Felucca, and the credits open with VIZZ (what it changes)
  and SKIFF (illuminus5); the crash screen VIZZ CRASH; the update
  loader's screens the VIZZ INSTALLER (its font: V and Z); MENU >
  THEME shows the default as VIZZ (the editor's theme list keeps SKIFF)
- the version v1.0 (FELUCCA_VERSION; build.py --release 1.0)
- the identity FM-1_800, a release FM-1_8XY (Skiff's 7XY, Felucca's
  9XY): app, loader, M-UPGRADE entry, fm1_install.py and the web
  updater read only the model before "_"; the package vizz-X.Y.fwsc
- L, the large face: Z (ABOUT's VIZZ), the pixel face too
- web/make_vizz_installer.py: the installer page (index_pkg.html) as
  one file with the package in it as a data: URL, its words Vizz's
- the USB names and descriptors stay the FM-1's
- README.md: the notice; BUILDING.md: the release and the installer

Tests: the splash's lines (ui_render), the L face's strings (ui_test),
the package identity (test_web: FM-1_8xx) and MENU > THEME's names
(test_web: VIZZ for SKIFF).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01257TywRk7Y9DD2HfKqtetj
